{"title": "Legendary Action: Tyrannical Branding", "pageid": 31407, "url": "https://bg3.wiki/wiki/Legendary_Action:_Tyrannical_Branding", "categories": ["Honour mode", "Passive features", "Pages using deprecated parameters"], "html": "<div class=\"mw-content-ltr mw-parser-output\" lang=\"en\" dir=\"ltr\"><div id=\"bg3wiki-honour-content-notice\" class=\"noexcerpt navigation-not-searchable\" style=\"background: linear-gradient(to right, #443E20, #232323); border-radius:10px; max-width: 630px; padding: 5px; width: auto; padding: 4px 10px; margin-bottom: 10px;\"><span typeof=\"mw:File\"><span><picture><source srcset=\"/w/images/thumb/a/a0/Honour_Icon.webp/22px-Honour_Icon.webp, /w/images/thumb/a/a0/Honour_Icon.webp/33px-Honour_Icon.webp 1.5x, /w/images/thumb/a/a0/Honour_Icon.webp/44px-Honour_Icon.webp 2x\"><img src=\"/w/images/thumb/a/a0/Honour_Icon.webp/22px-Honour_Icon.webp\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"22\" height=\"22\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></span><a href=\"/w/images/a/a0/Honour_Icon.webp\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a></span> This page is about content exclusive to <a href=\"/wiki/Honour_mode\" class=\"mw-redirect\" title=\"Honour mode\">Honour mode</a>.</div>\n\n<div class=\"bg3wiki-tooltip-box bg3wiki-tooltip-gradient-common\">\n<figure class=\"mw-default-size mw-halign-right\" typeof=\"mw:File/Frameless\"><a href=\"/wiki/File:Legendary_Action_Offensive.webp\" class=\"mw-file-description\"><picture><source srcset=\"/w/images/thumb/2/2c/Legendary_Action_Offensive.webp/300px-Legendary_Action_Offensive.webp, /w/images/2/2c/Legendary_Action_Offensive.webp 1.5x\"><img src=\"/w/images/thumb/2/2c/Legendary_Action_Offensive.webp/300px-Legendary_Action_Offensive.webp\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"300\" height=\"300\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></a><a href=\"/w/images/2/2c/Legendary_Action_Offensive.webp\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a><figcaption></figcaption></figure>\n<p><b>Legendary Action: Tyrannical Branding</b> is a <a href=\"/wiki/Passive_feature\" title=\"Passive feature\">passive feature</a> available to <a href=\"/wiki/Enver_Gortash\" title=\"Enver Gortash\">Enver Gortash</a> in <a href=\"/wiki/Honour_Mode\" class=\"mw-redirect\" title=\"Honour Mode\">Honour Mode</a> that lets him use a <a href=\"/wiki/Legendary_action\" class=\"mw-redirect\" title=\"Legendary action\">Legendary action</a> to retaliate against his attacker.\n</p>\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Description\"> Description </span></h2>\n<p>Once per round, Gortash can use his Legendary Action to immediately <span class=\"bg3wiki-icontext-icon nowrap\"><span class=\"mw-default-size bg3wiki-icon\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"/wiki/Tyrannical_Branding\" title=\"Tyrannical Branding\"><picture><source srcset=\"/w/images/thumb/3/3e/Generic_Force_Icon.webp/25px-Generic_Force_Icon.webp, /w/images/thumb/3/3e/Generic_Force_Icon.webp/38px-Generic_Force_Icon.webp 1.5x, /w/images/thumb/3/3e/Generic_Force_Icon.webp/50px-Generic_Force_Icon.webp 2x\"><img alt=\"Brand\" src=\"/w/images/thumb/3/3e/Generic_Force_Icon.webp/25px-Generic_Force_Icon.webp\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"25\" height=\"25\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></a><a href=\"/w/images/3/3e/Generic_Force_Icon.webp\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a></span></span> <a href=\"/wiki/Tyrannical_Branding\" title=\"Tyrannical Branding\">Brand</a> his attacker after being struck. \n</p><p><span style=\"color: white;\">Legendary Actions restore at the start of each round.</span>\n</p>\n<div style=\"clear: both;\"></div>\n</div><h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Condition:_Legendary_Action:_Tyrannical_Branding\"> Condition: Legendary Action: Tyrannical Branding </span></h2>\n<div class=\"bg3wiki-tooltip-box bg3wiki-tooltip-gradient-common\">\n<div class=\"bg3wiki-condition\"><strong><span class=\"bg3wiki-icontext-icon nowrap\"><span class=\"bg3wiki-icon\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"/wiki/Legendary_Action:_Tyrannical_Branding_(Condition)\" title=\"Legendary Action: Tyrannical Branding (Condition)\"><picture><source srcset=\"/w/images/thumb/5/5b/Legendary_Action_Offensive_Condition_Icon.webp/30px-Legendary_Action_Offensive_Condition_Icon.webp, /w/images/thumb/5/5b/Legendary_Action_Offensive_Condition_Icon.webp/45px-Legendary_Action_Offensive_Condition_Icon.webp 1.5x, /w/images/thumb/5/5b/Legendary_Action_Offensive_Condition_Icon.webp/60px-Legendary_Action_Offensive_Condition_Icon.webp 2x\"><img alt=\"Legendary Action: Tyrannical Branding\" src=\"/w/images/thumb/5/5b/Legendary_Action_Offensive_Condition_Icon.webp/30px-Legendary_Action_Offensive_Condition_Icon.webp\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"30\" height=\"30\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></a><a href=\"/w/images/5/5b/Legendary_Action_Offensive_Condition_Icon.webp\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a></span></span> <a href=\"/wiki/Legendary_Action:_Tyrannical_Branding_(Condition)\" title=\"Legendary Action: Tyrannical Branding (Condition)\">Legendary Action: Tyrannical Branding</a></strong>\n<div>\n<ul><li>Immediately after being struck, Gortash can <span class=\"bg3wiki-icontext-icon nowrap\"><span class=\"mw-default-size bg3wiki-icon\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"/wiki/Tyrannical_Branding\" title=\"Tyrannical Branding\"><picture><source srcset=\"/w/images/thumb/3/3e/Generic_Force_Icon.webp/25px-Generic_Force_Icon.webp, /w/images/thumb/3/3e/Generic_Force_Icon.webp/38px-Generic_Force_Icon.webp 1.5x, /w/images/thumb/3/3e/Generic_Force_Icon.webp/50px-Generic_Force_Icon.webp 2x\"><img alt=\"Brand\" src=\"/w/images/thumb/3/3e/Generic_Force_Icon.webp/25px-Generic_Force_Icon.webp\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"25\" height=\"25\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></a><a href=\"/w/images/3/3e/Generic_Force_Icon.webp\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a></span></span> <a href=\"/wiki/Tyrannical_Branding\" title=\"Tyrannical Branding\">Brand</a> his attacker.</li></ul>\n</div>\n </div>\n</div> \n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"How_to_learn\"> How to learn </span></h2>\n<div class=\"bg3wiki-tooltip-box\">\n<p><i>(Information not yet added.)</i>\n</p>\n</div>      \n<!-- \nNewPP limit report\nCached time: 20260714202034\nCache expiry: 86400\nReduced expiry: false\nComplications: [no‐toc]\nCPU time usage: 0.045 seconds\nReal time usage: 0.053 seconds\nPreprocessor visited node count: 1042/1000000\nPost‐expand include size: 9984/4194304 bytes\nTemplate argument size: 3610/4194304 bytes\nHighest expansion depth: 19/200\nExpensive parser function count: 0/750\nUnstrip recursion depth: 0/20\nUnstrip post‐expand size: 0/5000000 bytes\nExtLoops count: 40/1000\nLua time usage: 0.004/7.000 seconds\nLua memory usage: 643749/52428800 bytes\n-->\n<!--\nTransclusion expansion time report (%,ms,calls,template)\n100.00%   47.762      1 -total\n 98.88%   47.229      1 Template:Passive_feature_page\n 27.97%   13.358      2 Template:Icon_link\n 27.10%   12.943      2 Template:Icon_text\n 26.15%   12.492      1 Template:Condition\n 24.71%   11.803      1 Template:SAI\n 23.65%   11.296      6 Template:Trim\n 18.77%    8.964      2 Template:Ifempty\n 12.95%    6.185      1 Template:PageSeo\n 12.06%    5.760      1 Template:Hidden_code\n-->\n\n<!-- Saved in parser cache with key bg3wiki:pcache:idhash:31407-0!canonical and timestamp 20260714202034 and revision id 272560. Rendering was triggered because: api-parse\n -->\n</div>"}